From 2c1630bc97536a470cbb5d0d1f2e1f58d524b440 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Abhishek <apatgaonkar@habana.ai>
Date: Fri, 22 Mar 2024 11:43:06 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [FSW-2704] fs1: load ppboot firmware

This patch add support to load ppboot.
Image validation will be added as part
of security features.

Change-Id: I96069cd8201812fbe537a00f8b207b744a8e99e8
---

